index=web sourcetype=apache_error
| rex field=_raw "\[(?<apache_module>[\w_]+):(?<log_level>\w+)\]"
| rex field=_raw "(?<error_code>AH\d{5}):"
| search apache_module="proxy" log_level="error"
| stats count by error_code
| sort -count

I noticed HTTP 500 errors during checkout, so I would check the Apache error logs for more details. 
I use SPL to identify proxy errors and count them by error code. 
This helps me understand whether the issue might be related to communication with the backend server.
